 "description": "What each platform accepts. Called with nothing, it lists every platform with the media kinds and counts it takes and its caption limit \u2014 enough to decide where a post can go. Name platforms to add their recommended sizes and durations, their options with what each one does, and the quirks that decide how a post is treated. Read this before scheduling rather than discovering the rules by being rejected.",
